known_false_positives.description:
**Bug: Incorrect function used for double conversion**

The `valueFromLine<double>` specialization uses `std::strtof` which returns a `float`, not a `double`. This will cause precision loss when parsing double values from the FRD file.

**Fix:**

```suggestion
void valueFromLine<double>(const std::string_view::iterator& it, int digits, double& value)
{
    std::string_view sub(&*it, digits);
    value = std::strtod(sub.data(), nullptr);
}
```
